Send the stored credential to a base URL set by a project .roark.json. Refused by default.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
roark autoimprove job create \-\-agent\-id <value> \-\-objective\-metric\-definition\-id <value> \-\-objective\-label <value>
.fi
.RE
